## Vocabulary and decisions

Use the glossary's terms in ticket titles, proposals, hypotheses, and tests. Keep all ADRs under `docs/adr/`. Update the ADR index when a decision is recorded.

If a proposal conflicts with an ADR, name the ADR and explain why it should be reopened. Keep the existing ADR authoritative until the decision changes.

